'Subject: announcing a new enron brown bag seminar - \" how to win a bowl game \"\nthe following seminar will be given several times this year . the\ndistinguished list of speakers is as follows :\nbryan hull\nchad landry\ntim blanchard\nbob cotten\na cameo appearance will be made by dr . mick walters , esq . of course , this\nseminar will be moderated by yours truly .\nsign up early , since there were so many texas teams in bowl games , and\ntherefore so many losers , the seminars are sure to fill up , rapidly .\np . love - i am sure it is little consolation , but at least you covered .\np . s . jody you better get with us soon and then fly immediately to miami\nto give this invaluable info to bobby stoops .',ham
