'Subject: june specials ! !\n* * summer specials * *\nvalued golfers of kingwood cove .\nat your convenience please visit the following\nsites being developed for your benefit in the future .\nhttp : / / subscribe - 90027 - members @ lists . clubcorp . com / or\nhttp : / / www . ttimeonline . com / index . html\n* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *\n* * play & pay * *\n3 play for the price of 2\n4 play for the price of 3\nafter 11 am - saturday , sunday & holidays\n( offer valid with purchase of cart & green fee per player )\nmust present e - mail invitation prior to registration .\nnot valid with sr / jr rates or other offers . expires 06 / 30 / 00 .\ncall now to book your tee - time . 281 - 358 - 1155 .\n* * pick your partner / price * *\nmonday thru friday between 10 am - 2 pm ( non - holiday )\n2 play for $ 18 ea .\n3 play for $ 16 ea .\n4 play for $ 14 ea .\n( offer includes cart & green fee )\nmust present e - mail invitation prior to registration .\nnot valid with sr / jr rates , tournaments or other offers . expires 06 / 30 / 00\ncall now to book your tee - time . 281 - 358 - 1155 .\n* * 2 for 1 special * *\ntwo play for the price of one .\nbefore 10 am & after 2 pm\nmonday thru friday non - holiday .\ngolf invitation good for up to 4 players .\noffer includes 1 / 2 cart & green fee .\nmust present e - mail invitation prior to registration .\nnot valid with other offers or sr / jr rates . expires 06 / 30 / 00\ncall now to book your tee - time .\n281 - 358 - 1155 .\n* * golf lesson special * *\nlessons save $ 10',ham
