'Subject: force majeure situation - jennings plant\nthe volume was down to 1238 because of prev adjustments .\ncarlos\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - forwarded by carlos j rodriguez / hou / ect on 12 / 13 / 2000\n02 : 09 pm - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\nbeverly beaty\n12 / 13 / 2000 10 : 06 am\nto : carlos j rodriguez / hou / ect @ ect\ncc :\nsubject : force majeure situation - jennings plant\nfyi from devon\nbev\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - forwarded by beverly beaty / hou / ect on 12 / 13 / 2000 09 : 04\nam - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\nenron capital & trade resources corp .\nfrom : gary daniel\n12 / 13 / 2000 10 : 02 am\nto : beverly . beaty @ enron . com\ncc : cynthia . cantrell @ dvn . com\nsubject : force majeure situation - jennings plant\nbeverly :\ncould you please forward this to carlos ? i am at home\ntoday and do not have his e - mail .\nthanks .\ncarlos rodriguez\nenron\nvia e - mail\ndear carlos :\ndue to an electrical shortage at the jennings plant ,\nwhich shut the plant down , we are in a force majeure\nsituation effective immediately . the plant expects to\nbe back up tomorrow , december 14 . we will advise you\ntomorrow of the situation .\nwe are reducing our nomination to 0 effective today ,\ndecember 13 . the nomination was 1769 .\nplease call me if you have any questions .\nthanks .\nevelyn daniel\ndevon energy\n( 405 ) 552 - 4585 ( work )\n( 405 ) 391 - 9398',ham
