'Subject: gulf plains\nimbalance update : i spoke with mike bilberry and confirmed that this deal\nreally is energy in / energy out . we should not be impacted in any way by a\nreallocation to correct pvr percentages or a c 5 correction at the plant .\nhpl / ena should rereceive the same volume , dth for dth at the residue or at a\nredelivery point such as lobo / agua . i have left a message for my counterpart\nat duke and am requesting that they deliver to us , somewhere , an additional\n20 , 125 dth / day for the month of december to balance us out .\nplease let me know if you have any questions or comments . i will advise\neveryone upon their agreement to payback so that our respective positions\nreflect the additional supply .\nmary',ham
